---
import heroImg from '../../../images/stitch-solar-1.jpeg';
---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="hero-subtitle reveal slide-up">Premium Backup Systems</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title reveal slide-up" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">UPS Solutions for Reliable Power Backup</h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline reveal slide-up" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
      Are you fed up with sudden power cuts ruining your day or business tasks?
    </p>
    <p class="hero-desc reveal slide-up" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
      When the power goes off, having a strong and steady power backup system is vital. At Mahati Enterprises, we offer top-quality UPS systems for keeping your important equipment running without a hitch during blackouts. A power outage can harm your electronics, lead to data loss, or stop operations. This is where an Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS) comes into play.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style define:vars={{ heroBgUrl: `url("${heroImg.src}")` }}>
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #0b1c30;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding: 160px 24px;
      min-height: 70vh;
    }
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(#ffffff1a, #ffffff1a), linear-gradient(#0b1c30bf, #0b1c30e6), var(--heroBgUrl);
    background-position: center center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    display: block;
    color: #ffdbca; /* secondary-fixed */
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif);
  }

  .hero-title {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 56px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Manrope', sans-serif);
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    color: #d3e4fe; /* surface-variant */
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif);
  }

  .hero-desc {
    color: #eaf1ff; /* inverse-on-surface */
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    opacity: 0.9;
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif);
  }
</style>
